  m_Name: ColorCodeGame
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MinigameDefinition
  <Id>k__BackingField: color_code
  <SceneBuildIndex>k__BackingField: 14
  <GameType>k__BackingField: 2
  <GameDuration>k__BackingField: 120
  <IsTimeLimited>k__BackingField: 1
  <StartDelay>k__BackingField: 3
  <DisplayName>k__BackingField: Color Code
  <Description>k__BackingField: The show calls a colour - get onto a tile of that
    colour before the rest of the floor drops!
  <PreviewImage>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8e0fa490d01fa2e4faa63718e81f7b55, type: 3}
  <Rules>k__BackingField:
  - Read the called colour on the HUD
  - Find the nearest tile of that colour
  - Shoving rivals off your tile is allowed
  <Objective>k__BackingField: Stand on the called colour every time.
  <Danger>k__BackingField: Every other tile drops when the countdown ends. Fall and
    you're out. Calls get faster.
  <Scoring>k__BackingField: Last one standing wins; survivors tie at the bell.
  <Controls>k__BackingField:
  - LMB|Shove a rival off your tile
